# Conventional Commits (English only)

Use only when the user asks for a commit.

```
<type>(optional-scope): <short summary>
```

- Types: `feat`, `fix`, `refactor`, `docs`, `chore`, `build`, `perf`, `style`, `revert`.
- Imperative summary, lowercase after the type, no trailing period, about 72 characters.
- Body explains why, not a file list.
- Scope only when useful: `web`, `content`, `agent`.
- One concern per commit.
